-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ו/2 (18.6.2025): פתיחת תיקי גננות ודיווח משרות; העסקת עובדי הוראה, עובדי בעלות, בגני הילדים לחינוך מיוחד המוכרים שאינם רשמיים, בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש בשנה"ל תשפ"ו
-- Two topics for owners of recognised unofficial special-education
-- kindergartens not yet in Ofek Hadash: opening files and reporting
-- positions (for the kindergartens' profile), and joining the reform —
-- the owner's undertaking, who joins, the kindergarten work week and day,
-- part-time and over-time, a mother's position, age hours, activity hours,
-- seniority, promotion, the allowances, the grade, the advance, and the
-- annexes (the letter and undertaking on the advance, the forms, the
-- worked work-week table).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in DAYS from the circular's date,
-- 18 June 2025 (day 0): 31 August 2025 is day 74, 31 December 2025 day 196.
`31 August 2025`   MEANS 74
`31 December 2025` MEANS 196

§ `תשפ"ו/2 גני ילדים לחינוך מיוחד מוכרים שאינם רשמיים באופק חדש`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (18.6.2025), reference, addressee (owners of recognised unofficial special-education kindergartens not yet in Ofek Hadash), greeting and the two subject lines; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 The purpose: instructions on two topics, listed as א and ב.
-- akn:art_a/p1 The first topic: reporting for the kindergartens' profile (files and positions), encoded under stages A-E below.
-- akn:art_b/p1 The second topic: employing teachers in these kindergartens under Ofek Hadash in תשפ"ו, encoded under sections 1-17 below.

DECLARE `kindergarten party` IS ONE OF
    `the owning body`
    `the reporting officer`
    `the owner's contact person`
    `the teaching employee`
    `the teaching-staff division`
    `the Ministry`

DECLARE `kindergarten action` IS ONE OF
    `send the signed undertaking`
    `send the undertaking with proof of operating and paying by Ofek Hadash`
    `send the permission request form by e-mail`
    `approve the permission`
    `pass the permission to another person`
    `request a change of reporting officer in writing`
    `instruct the teachers to open an online file`
    `fill and send the questionnaire with education and seniority documents`
    `approve the file, certify the documents and report the institution or cluster code`
    `update grade and seniority, approve the documents and the file`
    `instruct existing teachers to check their data`
    `obtain an employment approval`
    `report every teacher's position`
    `compute the owner's profile`
    `submit an exceptional joining request` HAS `day submitted` IS A NUMBER
    `submit a request not to join` HAS `day submitted for leaving` IS A NUMBER
    `adjust the school day to the Ofek Hadash end hours`
    `send the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`
    `set the Ofek Hadash grade`
    `pay by the grade set and deduct the advances`
    `approve the owner's joining and join its kindergartens`
    `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` HAS `advance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `mark the advance on the payslip`
    `define one reporting officer` HAS `officer defined` IS A `reporting officer candidate`
    `identify the teachers meeting the joining conditions`
    `set the timetable by the Ofek Hadash work week`
    `decide each teacher's joining`
    `handle the exceptional joining requests`
    `handle the requests not to join`
    `reimburse the owner less the advances paid`
    `join Ofek Hadash`
    `have an under-qualified joiner sign to complete the education and send annex C`
    `pass the payslips on demand`
    `employ the joining teachers on the Ofek Hadash week and pay`
    `send each teacher the advance letter`
    `have each teacher sign the advance undertaking`
    `keep the teachers' undertakings and pass them on demand`
    `send the teachers' data as the Ministry requires`
    `send the payslips on demand`
    `apply all the Ofek Hadash provisions`
    `impose sanctions up to revoking the licence`

§§ `ג–ד Joining by 31.8.2025, and after it`

-- The owner joins by 31.8.2025 (ג, and 2.1.1.1 ¶5-¶6).
@ref akn:art_c/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p5 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the undertaking by 31.8.2025` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `send the signed undertaking`
    WITHIN `31 August 2025`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  `joining after the deadline`

-- After the date, an owner asking to join must add proof of operating by
-- the Ofek Hadash plan and of paying salaries on the circular's terms,
-- "provided these institutions received a late licence, i.e. after 1.9" (ד,
-- repeated in 2.1.1.1 ¶7).
@ref akn:art_d/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p7
`joining after the deadline` MEANS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MAY   `send the undertaking with proof of operating and paying by Ofek Hadash`

GIVEN `licensed after 1.9` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `ד lets the owner join after 31.8.2025` `licensed after 1.9` IF
    `licensed after 1.9`

-- The undertaking's own heading: "after this date the institution will not
-- be able to join Ofek Hadash in תשפ"ו".
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3/p32 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p33
GIVEN `licensed after 1.9` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the undertaking lets the owner join after 31.8.2025` `licensed after 1.9` IF
    FALSE

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_02-b: for an institution licensed after 1.9, ד admits a
-- late joining and the undertaking forbids it.
`ד and the undertaking disagree on joining late` MEANS
    `ד lets the owner join after 31.8.2025` TRUE AND NOT `the undertaking lets the owner join after 31.8.2025` TRUE
#ASSERT `ד and the undertaking disagree on joining late`

§§ `א Reporting the kindergarten teachers (stages A-E)`

-- From תשפ"א every teaching employee in such a kindergarten opens an online
-- file and the owner reports the employment every year; with the
-- information the Ministry, as regulator, sets education, certification,
-- seniority and further rights (training allowances, the jubilee grant,
-- joining Ofek Hadash, promotion), grants employment approvals, checks
-- criminal records and computes the budget profile.
@ref akn:art_d__para_a akn:art_d__para_a/p2 akn:art_d__para_a/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the yearly report` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `report every teacher's position`
    WITHIN 365

-- akn:art_d__para_a/p3 The purpose of the move (an information and management infrastructure, as for the schools); no rule.
-- akn:art_d__para_a/p5 A request to follow the instructions below, and why; the duties are encoded below.
-- akn:art_d__para_a/p6 The heading of the list of actions required of the owner; no rule.

@desc The person an owning body names as its reporting officer.
DECLARE `reporting officer candidate` HAS
    `an employee of the owning body`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc in an employer-employee relation with the owning body
    `a service provider`              IS A BOOLEAN

-- Stage A: ONE reporting officer, the owner's employee (not a service
-- provider), preferably from human resources. The owner's contact files
-- the permission form by e-mail; the teaching-staff division checks and
-- approves it. The permission is personal; a change needs a written
-- request; no more than one per owner.
@ref akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owning body defines its reporting officer` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `define one reporting officer` c
          PROVIDED `may be the reporting officer` c

GIVEN c IS A `reporting officer candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be the reporting officer` c IF
    c's `an employee of the owning body` AND NOT c's `a service provider`

@ref akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_1/p5
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the reporting officer's permission` IS
    PARTY `the owner's contact person`
    MUST  `send the permission request form by e-mail`
    HENCE (PARTY `the teaching-staff division`
           MUST  `approve the permission`)

@ref akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_1/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the permission is personal` IS
    PARTY `the reporting officer`
    SHANT `pass the permission to another person`
    LEST BREACH BY `the reporting officer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/2 stage A: the permission is personal and may not be passed on"

-- A change of reporting officer needs a written request to the Ministry.
GIVEN `the owner wants another reporting officer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `a change of reporting officer` `the owner wants another reporting officer` IS
    IF `the owner wants another reporting officer`
    THEN PARTY `the owning body`
         MUST  `request a change of reporting officer in writing`
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_1/p7
GIVEN `reporting officers requested` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `reporting officers approved` `reporting officers requested` IS
    min `reporting officers requested` 1

-- Stage B: every year the owner instructs its teaching staff (kindergarten
-- teachers and health professions) who have no file to open one. The file
-- is opened in three stages, in order: the teacher sends the questionnaire;
-- the reporting officer approves, certifies true copies and reports the
-- institution (in a cluster, the cluster's code, not the kindergarten's);
-- the division sets grade and seniority.
@ref akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_2__cls_a
GIVEN `a file was opened before` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the yearly instruction to open files` `a file was opened before` IS
    IF `a file was opened before`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the owning body`
         MUST  `instruct the teachers to open an online file`
         WITHIN 365

@ref akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_2__cls_b akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_2__cls_c akn:art_d__para_a__subpara_2__cls_d
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the three stages of a file` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `fill and send the questionnaire with education and seniority documents`
    HENCE (PARTY `the reporting officer`
           MUST  `approve the file, certify the documents and report the institution or cluster code`
           HENCE (PARTY `the teaching-staff division`
                  MUST  `update grade and seniority, approve the documents and the file`))

-- In a kindergarten cluster the reporting officer reports the cluster's
-- code, not the kindergarten's.
GIVEN `employed in a cluster` IS A BOOLEAN, `kindergarten code` IS A STRING, `cluster code` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the code to report` `employed in a cluster` `kindergarten code` `cluster code` IS
    IF `employed in a cluster` THEN `cluster code` ELSE `kindergarten code`



-- akn:art_e/p1 Detailed instructions and a user guide are published in the teachers' portal; no rule.

-- ו: the owner instructs existing teachers with a file to check in the
-- portal that their education and seniority data are current; further
-- data go to the district, in one of three ways.
@ref akn:art_f/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the instruction to existing teachers` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `instruct existing teachers to check their data`

DECLARE `way to update data` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:art_f/p2
    `the teacher brings the originals to the district at reception hours`
    @ref akn:art_f/p3
    `the teacher mails the originals to the district`
    @ref akn:art_f/p4
    `the reporting officer e-mails true copies to the district`

-- akn:art_f/p5 Where to find which district an institution belongs to; no rule.
-- akn:art_f/p6 Points to attached portal instructions on opening a file; they are not in the corpus.
-- akn:art_f/p7 The link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_3/p1 The heading "שלב ג'" with its text: the owner obtains an employment approval for every teacher, on the conditions of the procedure for תשפ"ו (not in the corpus).

@ref akn:art_f__para_3/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `an employment approval for every teacher` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `obtain an employment approval`

-- Stage D: every teacher the owner employs is placed in the Ministry's
-- reporting systems — those joining on reform terms, the rest on
-- pre-reform terms; the duty is every owner's, joined or not. Stage E:
-- then the owner's profile is computed in עוש"ר by its teachers'
-- characteristics and the reported employment.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3/p2 akn:art_f__para_3/p3 akn:art_f__para_3/p4
GIVEN `the owner joined Ofek Hadash` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `every owner reports the positions` `the owner joined Ofek Hadash` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `report every teacher's position`

@ref akn:art_f__para_4 akn:art_f__para_4/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the profile after the earlier stages` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `report every teacher's position`
    HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry`
           MUST  `compute the owner's profile`)

§§ `ב.1 מבוא`

-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b/p1 The heading of part ב; its sections follow.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p1 The heading "מבוא"; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p2 A recital: the State's notice in HCJ 6677/19 (the recognised-unofficial schools forum) to equalise teaching resources in these kindergartens.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p3 A recital: the inter-ministerial team, whose conclusions were adopted from תשפ"א.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p4 The team's report is at the link that follows; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p5 The report's address; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p6 A recital: from תשפ"א Ofek Hadash's terms were applied to these kindergartens.
-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p12 The chapter's purpose: the instructions for teachers employed by owners in these kindergartens in תשפ"ו.

-- Regulation 3(6) of the State Education (Recognised Institutions)
-- Regulations (2022): a special-education institution pays by the official
-- special-education rates of the new programme; so every special-education
-- institution not yet in Ofek Hadash joins from תשפ"ה, subject to the
-- undertaking and to this circular.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p7 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p8 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p9 akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p10
GIVEN `the owner signed the undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN, `the owner meets the circular` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the kindergarten joins Ofek Hadash` `the owner signed the undertaking` `the owner meets the circular` IF
    `the owner signed the undertaking` AND `the owner meets the circular`

-- The Ministry alone approves joining, sets the grade and converts the
-- salary, and sets the education grade and seniority (again in 16.1).
@ref akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_1/p11 akn:art_f__para_16-1
`the authority on joining, grades and conversion` MEANS `the Ministry`

§§ `ב.2 תחומי אחריות ביישום הרפורמה`

-- akn:art_f__para_4__subpara_b__cls_2/p1 The heading "תחומי אחריות ביישום הרפורמה"; its items follow.
-- akn:art_f__para_2-1/p1 The heading "שלב ראשון"; its items follow.
-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1/p1 The heading "actions by the owning body"; they follow.

-- 2.1.1.1: until the regulations are amended, the owner undertakes to
-- apply Ofek Hadash; the undertaking goes to the Ministry by e-mail, and
-- annexes A and B (the advance letter and the teacher's undertaking) stay
-- with the owner for management and later control.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p4
GIVEN `document` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sent to the Ministry` `document` IF
    `document` EQUALS "the undertaking"

-- 2.1.1.2–2.1.1.4: open files (part א); identify the teachers meeting the
-- joining conditions (section 3); report the positions of all teachers,
-- joining or not.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p8 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p9 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p10 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p11 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p12
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owner's first-stage report` IS
    (PARTY `the owning body`
     MUST  `instruct the teachers to open an online file`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the owning body`
     MUST  `identify the teachers meeting the joining conditions`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the owning body`
     MUST  `report every teacher's position`)

-- 2.1.1.5: the joining teachers work the Ofek Hadash week and are paid by
-- Ofek Hadash, and until the grade is set by the advance "as in section 12
-- below". 2.1.1.9: once the grade is set, the owner pays by it from the
-- joining date and deducts the advances "as in section 12 below".
-- F-2025-26_tashpo_02-e: section 12 is the kindergarten management
-- allowance; the advances are section 17.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_5 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_9
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owner's grade stage` IS
    (PARTY `the owning body`
     MUST  `employ the joining teachers on the Ofek Hadash week and pay`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the owning body`
     MUST  `send the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`
     HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry`
            MUST  `set the Ofek Hadash grade`
            HENCE (PARTY `the owning body`
                   MUST  `pay by the grade set and deduct the advances`)))

DECLARE `section of part ב` IS ONE OF
    `section 3`, `section 4`, `section 5`, `section 6`, `section 7`, `section 8`, `section 9`,
    `section 10`, `section 11`, `section 12`, `section 13`, `section 14`, `section 15`,
    `section 16`, `section 17`

GIVEN s IS A `section of part ב`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the subject of` s IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `section 7` THEN "a mother's position"
    WHEN `section 8` THEN "age hours"
    WHEN `section 11` THEN "promotion in grades"
    WHEN `section 12` THEN "the allowances of kindergarten teachers by role (management)"
    WHEN `section 17` THEN "salary advances until the grade is set"
    OTHERWISE "another subject"

`2.1.1.5 and 2.1.1.9 cite section 12 for the advances, which section 17 holds` MEANS
        `the subject of` `section 12` EQUALS "the allowances of kindergarten teachers by role (management)"
    AND `the subject of` `section 17` EQUALS "salary advances until the grade is set"
#ASSERT `2.1.1.5 and 2.1.1.9 cite section 12 for the advances, which section 17 holds`

-- 2.1.1.6–2.1.1.7: adjust the school day to the Ofek Hadash end hours
-- (4.1.4) and set the timetable by the Ofek Hadash week.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_6 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_7
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the day and the timetable adjusted` IS
    (PARTY `the owning body`
     MUST  `adjust the school day to the Ofek Hadash end hours`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the owning body`
     MUST  `set the timetable by the Ofek Hadash work week`)

-- 2.1.2: the Ministry approves the joining of owners that signed in time
-- and joins their kindergartens; handles exceptional joining requests
-- (3.2.1) and requests not to join (3.6); after files and reports, decides
-- each teacher's joining; sets the grades; computes the profile; and
-- reimburses the owner for the joining teachers employed on the Ofek
-- Hadash week and pay, less the advances paid.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4__pnt_a akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4__pnt_b akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4__pnt_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the Ministry's part` IS
    (PARTY `the Ministry`
     MUST  `approve the owner's joining and join its kindergartens`
     HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry`
            MUST  `decide each teacher's joining`
            HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry`
                   MUST  `set the Ofek Hadash grade`
                   HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry`
                          MUST  `compute the owner's profile`
                          HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry`
                                 MUST  `reimburse the owner less the advances paid`)))))
    RAND
    (PARTY `the Ministry`
     MUST  `handle the exceptional joining requests`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the Ministry`
     MUST  `handle the requests not to join`)

GIVEN `reimbursable salary` IS A NUMBER, `advances paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reimbursement` `reimbursable salary` `advances paid` IS
    `reimbursable salary` MINUS `advances paid`

§§ `3 תנאי ההצטרפות`

-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4__pnt_c__pnt_3 The heading "תנאי ההצטרפות", which the corpus nests under 2.1.2.4ג; its sections follow.
-- akn:art_f__para_3-1/p1 The heading "הגדרות".

@desc A teaching employee of the kindergarten, as far as the joining conditions ask.
DECLARE `kindergarten teacher` HAS
    `has prior recognised teaching seniority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc years of actual teaching recognised before (an internship, army or national service in teaching do not count, 3.1.1)
    `academic`                IS A BOOLEAN @desc a degree from an Israeli institution, a recognised foreign degree, or an approved equivalent salary grade (3.1.3)
    `certified to teach`      IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teaching certificate or certification by another way the Ministry allows (3.1.4)
    `seniority in years`      IS A NUMBER
    `position fraction`       IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position (1 = 100%)

DECLARE `education` IS ONE OF
    `first degree`
    `second degree`
    `doctorate`
    `בכיר`
    `מוסמך`
    `בלתי מוסמך`

DECLARE `salary table` IS ONE OF
    `first-degree table`
    `second-degree table`
    `senior (בכיר) table`
    `certified (מוסמך) table`
    `uncertified table`

DECLARE `purpose of seniority` IS ONE OF
    `salary seniority`
    `minimum period for promotion`
    `tenure`
    `jubilee grant seniority`
    `recuperation seniority`

DECLARE `reason not to join` IS ONE OF
    `health with current medical proof`
    `a personal change for the worse`
    `another reason`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-1 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-2 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-3 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-4
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an existing teacher` t IF
    t's `has prior recognised teaching seniority`

-- 3.2.1: an existing academic joins if certified and at a third of a
-- position or more. 3.3.1: an existing non-academic with 28 years or more
-- joins in any case.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-3/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins Ofek Hadash` t IF
        `is an existing teacher` t
    AND (    (t's `academic` AND t's `certified to teach` AND t's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3)
          OR ((NOT t's `academic`) AND t's `seniority in years` AT LEAST 28))

-- An uncertified teacher may ask the exceptions committee, through the
-- owner, on annex C's form, by 31.12.2025.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p7
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `an exceptional joining request` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `submit an exceptional joining request` d
          PROVIDED d AT MOST `31 December 2025`
    WITHIN `31 December 2025`

-- Annex C's own heading: "the last date to send the form is 31.8.2025".
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1/p1
`annex C's deadline` MEANS `31 August 2025`

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_02-c: the body and annex C give two deadlines.
`3.2.1 and annex C give different deadlines` MEANS
    NOT (`annex C's deadline` EQUALS `31 December 2025`)
#ASSERT `3.2.1 and annex C give different deadlines`

-- Below 25 years, no promotion until certified; the period and part of
-- the studies count "as in section 12.2.2" (F-2025-26_tashpo_02-f: 12.2 is
-- the management allowance; the promotion rule is 11.2.2).
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p8 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p9
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an uncertified teacher may not be promoted` t IF
    (NOT t's `certified to teach`) AND t's `seniority in years` LESS THAN 25

`3.2.1 cites 12.2.2, a management-allowance section, for promotion` MEANS
    `the subject of` `section 12` EQUALS "the allowances of kindergarten teachers by role (management)"
    AND `the subject of` `section 11` EQUALS "promotion in grades"
#ASSERT `3.2.1 cites 12.2.2, a management-allowance section, for promotion`

-- 3.4: a new academic teacher at grade 1 and seniority 1 in the table of
-- the degree; a doctorate in the second-degree table plus 5% of the
-- combined salary; a new non-academic not entitled to intern's pay by
-- education.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-4/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-2
GIVEN e IS AN `education`
GIVETH A `salary table`
DECIDE `the table a new teacher is placed in` e IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `first degree` THEN `first-degree table`
    WHEN `second degree` THEN `second-degree table`
    WHEN `doctorate` THEN `second-degree table`
    WHEN `בכיר` THEN `senior (בכיר) table`
    WHEN `מוסמך` THEN `certified (מוסמך) table`
    WHEN `בלתי מוסמך` THEN `uncertified table`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-4__subpara_3-4-1/p6
GIVEN e IS AN `education`, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `doctorate supplement` e `combined salary` IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `doctorate` THEN `combined salary` TIMES 0.05
    OTHERWISE 0

-- 3.5: interns only on reform terms; the year counts only at a third of a
-- position or more for at least six months of the year (July and August
-- excluded); two school years at most, by which a degree and a certificate
-- are completed; not counted for salary seniority or promotion periods,
-- counted for tenure, the jubilee grant and recuperation.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-1
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `months at that position, July and August excluded` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship year is recognised` `position fraction` `months at that position, July and August excluded` IF
    `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3 AND `months at that position, July and August excluded` AT LEAST 6

-- 3.5.1's first sentence: in a kindergarten that joined, an intern is
-- employed on the reform's terms only.
GIVEN `the kindergarten joined Ofek Hadash` IS A BOOLEAN, `on the reform's terms` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the intern's terms are allowed` `the kindergarten joined Ofek Hadash` `on the reform's terms` IF
    (NOT `the kindergarten joined Ofek Hadash`) OR `on the reform's terms`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-2
GIVEN `school years of internship` IS A NUMBER, `completed a degree and a certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the intern may stay on reform terms` `school years of internship` `completed a degree and a certificate` IF
    `school years of internship` AT MOST 2 OR `completed a degree and a certificate`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-3
GIVEN p IS A `purpose of seniority`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship counts for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `salary seniority` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `minimum period for promotion` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- 3.6.1: as a rule, every teacher meeting the conditions of joining is
-- bound to join Ofek Hadash; the text sets no deadline.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-1
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `a teacher meeting the conditions joins` t IS
    IF `joins Ofek Hadash` t
    THEN PARTY `the teaching employee`
         MUST  `join Ofek Hadash`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 3.6.2–3.6.4: in exceptional cases (health with current proof, or a personal change for
-- the worse) a request not to join may be considered, on annex D's form,
-- through the owner, by 31.12.2025.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-3 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-4
GIVEN r IS A `reason not to join`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a request not to join may be considered` r IF
    NOT (r EQUALS `another reason`)

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-5
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `a request not to join` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `submit a request not to join` d
          PROVIDED d AT MOST `31 December 2025`
    WITHIN `31 December 2025`

-- Annex D's own heading: "the last date to send the form is 31.8.2025".
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p1
`annex D's deadline` MEANS `31 August 2025`

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_02-d.
`3.6.5 and annex D give different deadlines` MEANS
    NOT (`annex D's deadline` EQUALS `31 December 2025`)
#ASSERT `3.6.5 and annex D give different deadlines`

-- 3.7: a substitute in weekly hours (scheduled over time, e.g. for a
-- teacher on maternity leave; not single or effective hours) is employed
-- on the terms of the teacher replaced.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-7/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-7/p2
GIVEN `the replaced teacher is in the reform` IS A BOOLEAN, `employed in weekly hours over time` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the substitute is on reform terms` `the replaced teacher is in the reform` `employed in weekly hours over time` IF
    `employed in weekly hours over time` AND `the replaced teacher is in the reform`

§§ `4 מבנה שבוע העבודה בגני הילדים`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-7__subpara_4 The heading of section 4, which the corpus nests under 3.7; its items follow.
-- akn:art_f__para_4-1/p1 The heading of 4.1, pointing to annex E for the kindergarten teachers' week.
-- akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p1 The heading "בסיס המשרה"; the table follows.

@desc A row of 4.1.2's cluster table.
DECLARE `cluster row` HAS
    `fewest kindergartens`   IS A NUMBER
    `most kindergartens`     IS A NUMBER
    `frontal or enrichment hours` IS A NUMBER
    `cluster management hours`    IS A NUMBER
    `cluster total`               IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `kind of disability` IS ONE OF
    `physical`
    `deaf and hard of hearing`
    `blind and visually impaired`
    `moderate intellectual`
    `moderate complex intellectual`
    `severe, profound or nursing intellectual`
    `autism`
    `severe mental disorders`
    `mild intellectual`
    `every other kind`

@desc A full-time work week.
DECLARE `work week` HAS
    `week total hours`  IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours`     IS A NUMBER
    `individual hours`  IS A NUMBER
    `stay hours`        IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `kindergarten role` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten manager`
    @desc גננת עמיתה (until תשפ"ד "גננת משלימה")
    `associate kindergarten teacher`
    `cluster manager`

DECLARE `age status` IS ONE OF
    `under 50`
    @desc 50 up to 55, 55 not included
    `50 to 55`
    @desc 55 and over, a "new" teacher (3.1)
    `55 and over, new`
    @desc 55 and over, an "existing" teacher (3.1)
    `55 and over, existing`

-- 4.1.1's table of position bases (weekly hours).
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/t1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p8
GIVEN r IS A `kindergarten role`, a IS AN `age status`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position base` r a IS
    LET full MEANS CONSIDER r
                   WHEN `kindergarten manager` THEN 30.4
                   WHEN `associate kindergarten teacher` THEN 33.8
                   WHEN `cluster manager` THEN 34
    IN  CONSIDER a
        WHEN `under 50` THEN full
        WHEN `50 to 55` THEN full MINUS 2
        WHEN `55 and over, new` THEN full MINUS 2
        WHEN `55 and over, existing` THEN full MINUS 4

-- The table's figures, as printed, are its rows: each age status reduces
-- every role's base by the same hours (8.3–8.5: 2, 2, 4).
#ASSERT `the position base` `kindergarten manager` `50 to 55` EQUALS 28.4
#ASSERT `the position base` `associate kindergarten teacher` `55 and over, new` EQUALS 31.8
#ASSERT `the position base` `cluster manager` `55 and over, existing` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `the position base` `kindergarten manager` `55 and over, existing` EQUALS 26.4

-- The table's note ** sends "a kindergarten teacher entitled to age hours"
-- to "section 7 below" (F-2025-26_tashpo_02-g: section 7 is a mother's
-- position; age hours are section 8).
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p7
`the section note ** cites for age hours` MEANS `section 7`

`note ** cites section 7, a mother's position, for age hours` MEANS
        `the subject of` `the section note ** cites for age hours` EQUALS "a mother's position"
    AND `the subject of` `section 8` EQUALS "age hours"
#ASSERT `note ** cites section 7, a mother's position, for age hours`

-- 4.1.2: a kindergarten manager's and an associate's position is frontal
-- hours only; a cluster manager's 34 hours divide by the number of
-- kindergartens in the cluster.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/t1
`the cluster table` MEANS
    LIST `cluster row` 4 4 22 12 34,
         `cluster row` 5 5 19 15 34,
         `cluster row` 6 6 16 18 34,
         `cluster row` 7 7 13 21 34,
         `cluster row` 8 8 10 24 34,
         `cluster row` 9 9 7 27 34,
         `cluster row` 10 11 4 30 34

-- The first sentence: a kindergarten manager's and an associate's
-- position is made of frontal hours only.
`a kindergarten manager's or associate's position is frontal hours only` MEANS TRUE

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `frontal or enrichment hours` PLUS r's `cluster management hours` EQUALS r's `cluster total`) `the cluster table`

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `cluster row`
DECIDE `the cluster rows for` n IS
    filter (GIVEN r YIELD n AT LEAST r's `fewest kindergartens` AND n AT MOST r's `most kindergartens`) `the cluster table`

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_02-h: section 14 pays a cluster manager for "up to 6"
-- and "7 and over" kindergartens, but the hours table has rows for 4 to 11
-- only: a cluster of 2-3 or of 12 or more has no division of hours.
`a cluster of 3 or of 12 kindergartens has no row` MEANS
    count (`the cluster rows for` 3) EQUALS 0 AND count (`the cluster rows for` 12) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `a cluster of 3 or of 12 kindergartens has no row`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD count (`the cluster rows for` n) EQUALS 1) (range 4 11)

-- 4.1.3: work starts at 7:55. 4.1.4: the school day ends by the kind of
-- disability (Sunday-Thursday; Friday 12:45 for every kind). A kindergarten
-- that ended at 16:00 before the reform keeps its day, and the teacher adds
-- forty minutes along the day in overlap. A day ending at 14:00 is 6.08
-- working hours, and so on by the end hour.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-3
`the start of work` MEANS 7 PLUS 55 DIVIDED BY 60

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p9 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p10 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p11 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p12 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p13
GIVEN k IS A `kind of disability`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the end of the school day, Sunday to Thursday` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `autism` THEN 16 PLUS 45 DIVIDED BY 60
    WHEN `severe mental disorders` THEN 16
    WHEN `every other kind` THEN 14
    OTHERWISE 15 PLUS 10 DIVIDED BY 60

`the end of the school day on Friday` MEANS 12 PLUS 45 DIVIDED BY 60

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p14 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p15 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p16 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p17
GIVEN `end hour` IS A NUMBER, `ended at 16:00 before the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the working day in hours` `end hour` `ended at 16:00 before the reform` IS
    IF `ended at 16:00 before the reform`
    THEN 16 MINUS `the start of work` PLUS 40 DIVIDED BY 60
    ELSE `end hour` MINUS `the start of work`

-- 6.08 hours for a day ending at 14:00, to the hundredth.
#ASSERT TRUNC (`the working day in hours` 14 FALSE TIMES 100) 0 EQUALS 608

-- 4.1.5: the position is the weekly hours over the position base.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5/p3
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, `position base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position` `weekly hours` `position base` IS
    `weekly hours` DIVIDED BY `position base`

-- 4.2: health professions and arts therapists: 36 hours — 26 frontal, 3
-- individual (content set with the head of the setting), 7 stay hours on
-- the listed tasks.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_a akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_b akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p9
`the therapist's week` MEANS `work week` 36 26 3 7

#ASSERT `the therapist's week`'s `frontal hours` PLUS `the therapist's week`'s `individual hours` PLUS `the therapist's week`'s `stay hours` EQUALS 36

-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p10 Points to the detailed table of the therapists' week (as in a primary school); no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p11 The address; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p12 The address, continued; no rule.

§§ `5 העסקה בחלקיות משרה ברפורמה`

-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c__cls_5 The heading of section 5, which the corpus nests under 4.2ג; its items follow.

-- 5.1: an existing kindergarten teacher at least a third. 5.2: a new one
-- not below a third unless the division's head approved it. 5.3: an
-- associate joins only when her total in reform kindergartens is a third
-- or more, and then works reform terms there and pre-reform terms
-- elsewhere (below). 5.4: a health-profession teacher may work below a third.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-1 akn:art_f__para_5-2 akn:art_f__para_5-4
GIVEN existing IS A BOOLEAN, `health profession` IS A BOOLEAN, `approved below a third` IS A BOOLEAN, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the part-time position is allowed` existing `health profession` `approved below a third` `position fraction` IF
    `health profession`
    OR `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    OR ((NOT existing) AND `approved below a third`)

@ref akn:art_f__para_5-3
GIVEN `associate's total in reform kindergartens` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the associate works reform terms in the reform kindergartens` `associate's total in reform kindergartens` IF
    `associate's total in reform kindergartens` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- 5.5: a part-time therapist's week is cut in proportion; below a third,
-- frontal hours only, the position being their ratio to the base. 5.6:
-- below a third, the period does not count for promotion.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-5 akn:art_f__para_5-5/p2 akn:art_f__para_5-5/p3
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the part-time therapist's week` `position fraction` IS
    IF `position fraction` LESS THAN 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    THEN `work week` (36 TIMES `position fraction`) (36 TIMES `position fraction`) 0 0
    ELSE `work week` (36 TIMES `position fraction`) (26 TIMES `position fraction`) (3 TIMES `position fraction`) (7 TIMES `position fraction`)

@ref akn:art_f__para_5-6
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period counts towards the minimum period for promotion` `position fraction` IF
    `position fraction` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3

§§ `6 העסקה מעל 100% משרה`

-- Beyond a full position the total may not pass 42 weekly hours in all
-- modes and kinds of hours, and in no case are more than 42 approved
-- (under the exceptional-employment procedure for תשפ"ו, not in the corpus).
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p2 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p3 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p4
GIVEN `weekly hours in all employments` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the 42-hour ceiling` `weekly hours in all employments` IF
    `weekly hours in all employments` AT MOST 42

§§ `7 עובדת הוראה אם`

-- akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_7 The heading of section 7, which the corpus nests under 5.6; its items follow.

-- 7.1: a mother of a child up to 14 employed in her whole position at 79%
-- or more. 7.2: a kindergarten teacher who is a mother may be absent a full
-- day every two weeks or half a day every week, pay and position
-- unchanged; if, by consent and for the system's needs, she is never
-- absent, her position grows by 10% that year, even above 100%. 7.3: a
-- therapist mother works the regular reform week of the linked table.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-1
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `youngest child's age` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to a mother's position` `position fraction` `youngest child's age` IF
    `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79 AND `youngest child's age` AT MOST 14

@ref akn:art_f__para_7-2 akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_a akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b/p2
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `never absent all year by consent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a mother's position` `position fraction` `never absent all year by consent` IS
    IF `never absent all year by consent` THEN `position fraction` PLUS 0.1 ELSE `position fraction`

-- akn:art_f__para_7-3/p1 A therapist mother works the regular reform week of the linked table; no figures are printed here.
-- akn:art_f__para_7-3/p2 The pointer to the table; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_7-3/p3 The table's address; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_7-3/p4 The address, continued; no rule.

-- 7.4: after maternity leave, at 90% or more, for four months: a nursing
-- hour a day off the stay hours (five a week), pay and position unchanged;
-- 7.2 and 7.3 do not apply then, and the two are never given together.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-4 akn:art_f__para_7-4/p2
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `within four months of maternity leave` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `nursing hours off a week` `position fraction` `within four months of maternity leave` IS
    IF `within four months of maternity leave` AND `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.9 THEN 5 ELSE 0

§§ `8 זכאות לשעות גיל`

-- akn:art_f__para_7-4__subpara_8 The heading of section 8, which the corpus nests under 7.4; its items follow.

-- 8.1: by the age on 31 December of the school year, for the whole year.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-1
GIVEN `age on 31 December of the school year` IS A NUMBER, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `age status`
DECIDE `the age status for the year` `age on 31 December of the school year` existing IS
    IF `age on 31 December of the school year` LESS THAN 50 THEN `under 50`
    ELSE IF `age on 31 December of the school year` LESS THAN 55 THEN `50 to 55`
         ELSE IF existing THEN `55 and over, existing` ELSE `55 and over, new`

-- 8.3: an existing teacher aged 50-55: two frontal hours off her base,
-- position unchanged; 8.4: 55 and over: four hours; 8.5: a new teacher
-- from 50: two hours, and no more at 55. (4.1.1's table and annex E read
-- 50-55 as "not including" 55.)
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-3 akn:art_f__para_8-4 akn:art_f__para_8-5
GIVEN a IS AN `age status`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `age hours off a full base` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `under 50` THEN 0
    WHEN `50 to 55` THEN 2
    WHEN `55 and over, new` THEN 2
    WHEN `55 and over, existing` THEN 4

-- 8.2: a part-time teacher of 50 or over gets a partial reduction "by the
-- rules detailed below and the reform week". The reform week is 4.1.1's
-- reduced position base and 4.1.5's hours-over-base: a part-timer's hours
-- for a given position on the reduced base are her full-base hours less
-- the age hours pro rata, so the partial reduction is the full one times
-- the position fraction.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-2
GIVEN a IS AN `age status`, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `age hours off a part-time base` a `position fraction` IS
    `age hours off a full base` a TIMES min `position fraction` 1

-- A half-time manager of 50-55: half of 28.4 is half of 30.4 less one
-- age hour (half of two).
`a half-time manager of 50-55 works one hour less` MEANS
    0.5 TIMES `the position base` `kindergarten manager` `50 to 55`
    EQUALS (0.5 TIMES `the position base` `kindergarten manager` `under 50`)
           MINUS `age hours off a part-time base` `50 to 55` 0.5
#ASSERT `a half-time manager of 50-55 works one hour less`

-- akn:art_f__para_8-6/p1 A therapist's age hours follow the linked work-week tables; no figures are printed here.
-- akn:art_f__para_8-6/p2 The tables' address; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_8-6/p3 The address, continued; no rule.

§§ `9 שעות פעילות גן`

-- akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p1 The heading of section 9, which the corpus nests under 8.6; its items follow.

-- 9.1–9.2: on top of the position and pay, a payment for kindergarten
-- activities; hours allotted by the kindergarten's needs, at most 40 a
-- year (the half-year division is cancelled). 9.3–9.4: the purposes.
-- The payment's rate is not printed here; the closing note says the
-- collective agreements govern, so it is an input.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p2 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p3 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p4 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p5 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p6 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p7 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p8 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p9 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p10 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p11 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p12 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p13
GIVEN hours IS A NUMBER, `hours already allotted this year` IS A NUMBER, `pay per activity hour` IS A NUMBER @desc not printed in this circular, which says it collects the Ofek Hadash agreements and yields to them (closing note)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay for kindergarten activity` hours `hours already allotted this year` `pay per activity hour` IS
    max 0 (min hours (40 MINUS `hours already allotted this year`)) TIMES `pay per activity hour`

-- Ten hours asked with 35 already allotted: only 5 are paid (placeholder
-- rate of 100).
#ASSERT `pay for kindergarten activity` 10 35 100 EQUALS 500

§§ `10 ותק בהוראה`

-- akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_10 The heading of section 10, which the corpus nests under 8.6; its items follow.

DECLARE `period of service` IS ONE OF
    `teaching`
    `internship`
    `compulsory army service`
    `army or national service in teaching`
    `recognised for salary before joining`

@ref akn:art_f__para_10-1 akn:art_f__para_10-2
GIVEN p IS A `period of service`, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counts as recognised seniority` p existing IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `teaching` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `internship` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `compulsory army service` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `army or national service in teaching` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `recognised for salary before joining` THEN existing

§§ `11 קידום בדרגות`

@desc A promotion step.
DECLARE `promotion step` HAS
    `from grade`                  IS A NUMBER
    `months required`             IS A NUMBER
    `development hours required`  IS A NUMBER

-- 11.1: the minimum period, development hours and an evaluation. 11.2.1:
-- certified academics. 11.2.2: uncertified academics (veterans up to 25
-- years after certification: the period from joining, one promotion, up
-- to 60 study hours; from 25 years no certification needed; new ones from
-- certification). 11.2.3: certified non-academics of 28 years: 48 months
-- and 480 hours a step.
@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p2 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p3 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p4 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p8 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p14 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p15 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p16 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/t1
`the certified academics' steps` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` 1 30 120, `promotion step` 2 30 120, `promotion step` 3 36 180,
         `promotion step` 4 36 180, `promotion step` 5 36 180, `promotion step` 6 48 210,
         `promotion step` 7 48 210, `promotion step` 8 48 210

-- 11.1: promotion needs the step's minimum period, its development hours
-- and an evaluation.
GIVEN `months in the grade` IS A NUMBER, `development hours` IS A NUMBER, evaluated IS A BOOLEAN, step IS A `promotion step`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be promoted` `months in the grade` `development hours` evaluated step IF
        `months in the grade` AT LEAST step's `months required`
    AND `development hours` AT LEAST step's `development hours required`
    AND evaluated

-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p5 The heading of the link; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p6 The development outline's address; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p7 The address, continued; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p9 Points to evaluation details; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p10 The address; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p11 Points to the dimension map; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p12 The address; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p13 The address, continued; no rule.

@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p17 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p18 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p19 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p20 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p21 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p22
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`, `certified since joining` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `study hours counted as development hours` t `certified since joining` IS
    IF `is an existing teacher` t AND t's `seniority in years` LESS THAN 25 AND `certified since joining`
    THEN 60
    ELSE 0

-- Not promoted until certified — a veteran of 25 years or more excepted.
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`, `certified since joining` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an uncertified academic who joined by exception may be promoted` t `certified since joining` IF
    `certified since joining` OR (`is an existing teacher` t AND t's `seniority in years` AT LEAST 25)

-- On certification, a veteran under 25 years has the period from joining
-- counted, for one promotion only; a new teacher starts counting at
-- certification.
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `promotions the period before certification may earn` t IS
    IF `is an existing teacher` t AND t's `seniority in years` LESS THAN 25
    THEN 1
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p23 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/p24 akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_11/t2
`the certified non-academics' steps` MEANS
    map (GIVEN g YIELD `promotion step` g 48 480) (range 1 8)

§§ `12 גמול ניהול גן`

-- akn:art_f__para_10-2__subpara_12 The heading of section 12, which the corpus nests under 10.2; its items follow.

DECLARE `use of the supplement` IS ONE OF
    `the hour value`
    `severance pay`
    `substitute and activity pay`
    `absence deductions`
    `section 33ד pay`
    `training fund`
    `pension for a funded-pension associate`
    `the combined salary`
    `a base for other supplements`

DECLARE `special-education case` IS ONE OF
    `certified, formerly 9%`
    `certified, formerly 14%`
    `certified, in an autism or severe-mental-disorder kindergarten`
    `not certified`
    `not certified, in special education`

-- 12.1: from 1.9.2023, the higher of the rate of section 138א(1) of the
-- Ofek Hadash agreement and 1,500. 12.2: the other rules stand. The rates:
-- 17% (new, grade 1-2; existing, up to 5 years managing), 20% (grade 3-4;
-- 6-10 years), 21% (grade 5-9; above 10). A teacher who had a trailing
-- management or counselling allowance gets the higher of the two.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p5 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p6 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p7 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p8
GIVEN existing IS A BOOLEAN, grade IS A NUMBER, `years managing` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the management allowance rate` existing grade `years managing` IS
    IF existing
    THEN BRANCH IF `years managing` AT MOST 5 THEN 0.17
                IF `years managing` AT MOST 10 THEN 0.2
                OTHERWISE 0.21
    ELSE BRANCH IF grade AT MOST 2 THEN 0.17
                IF grade AT MOST 4 THEN 0.2
                OTHERWISE 0.21

@ref akn:art_f__para_12-1 akn:art_f__para_12-1__subpara_12-1-1 akn:art_f__para_12-1__subpara_12-1-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2 akn:art_f__para_12-2/p9
GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `trailing allowance` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the kindergarten management allowance` rate `combined salary` `trailing allowance` IS
    max (max (rate TIMES `combined salary`) 1500) `trailing allowance`

-- 13: the associate's supplement. An associate is the teacher in charge on
-- a fixed day the manager does not work; an eligible one has none of the
-- listed allowances (management, education, trailing, cluster management,
-- pay protection). From 1.9.2023: 10% of her combined salary, pro rata
-- part-time, and a full position's above 100%. It counts for the hour
-- value, severance, substitute and activity pay, absence deductions,
-- section 33ד, the training fund and pension, but is not part of the
-- combined salary nor a base for other supplements.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p7 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-1/p8 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-2
GIVEN `has none of the listed allowances` IS A BOOLEAN, `combined salary at a full position` IS A NUMBER, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the associate's supplement` `has none of the listed allowances` `combined salary at a full position` `position fraction` IS
    IF `has none of the listed allowances`
    THEN 0.1 TIMES `combined salary at a full position` TIMES min `position fraction` 1
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_13__cls_13-3
GIVEN u IS A `use of the supplement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the associate's supplement counts for` u IF
    CONSIDER u
    WHEN `the combined salary` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `a base for other supplements` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- 14: a special-education cluster manager: 25% up to 6 kindergartens, 28%
-- from 7; a kindergarten's coordinator in a cluster: an education
-- allowance of 10% (unless entitled to a trailing management allowance); a
-- mentor 2.4% per intern, up to 3.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p3 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p4
GIVEN `kindergartens in the cluster` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cluster management rate` `kindergartens in the cluster` IS
    IF `kindergartens in the cluster` AT MOST 6 THEN 0.25 ELSE 0.28

@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p5 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p6 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p7
GIVEN `entitled to a trailing management allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cluster coordinator's education rate` `entitled to a trailing management allowance` IS
    IF `entitled to a trailing management allowance` THEN 0 ELSE 0.1

@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p8 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_14/p9
GIVEN interns IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor's rate` interns IS
    0.024 TIMES min interns 3

-- 15: the special-education allowance (agreement of 19.10.2022, from
-- 1.9.2023, on section 39א(3)): certified, 9% to 10%, 14% to 15%, 17% in
-- an autism or severe-mental-disorder kindergarten; not certified, (א)
-- 5.5%, (ב) 8.5% in special education.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15/p2 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_1 akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_15__hc_2
GIVEN c IS A `special-education case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education allowance rate` c IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `certified, formerly 9%` THEN 0.1
    WHEN `certified, formerly 14%` THEN 0.15
    WHEN `certified, in an autism or severe-mental-disorder kindergarten` THEN 0.17
    WHEN `not certified` THEN 0.055
    WHEN `not certified, in special education` THEN 0.085

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_02-i: every teacher here is in a special-education
-- kindergarten, so an uncertified one is described by both (א) and (ב).
-- The reading adopted: (ב), the specific one.
GIVEN `teaches in special education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the rates for an uncertified teacher` `teaches in special education` IS
    IF `teaches in special education`
    THEN LIST `the special-education allowance rate` `not certified`, `the special-education allowance rate` `not certified, in special education`
    ELSE LIST `the special-education allowance rate` `not certified`

`an uncertified special-education teacher has two rates` MEANS
    count (`the rates for an uncertified teacher` TRUE) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `an uncertified special-education teacher has two rates`

§§ `16 קביעת הדרגה באופק חדש`

-- akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_16/p1 The heading of section 16, which the corpus nests under 12.2.

-- No grade can be set until the teacher's file is opened, the position
-- reported and the teacher joined. 16.2–16.5: the grade rests on
-- employment, education, seniority and the salary of the conversion month
-- (March of the year before, for an existing teacher: seniority, education
-- grade, training, role, stage), the components that do not continue at
-- 100%; it may be a half grade.
@ref akn:art_f__para_12-2__subpara_16/p2
GIVEN `file opened` IS A BOOLEAN, `position reported` IS A BOOLEAN, `joined` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grade can be set` `file opened` `position reported` `joined` IF
    `file opened` AND `position reported` AND `joined`

@ref akn:art_f__para_16-2 akn:art_f__para_16-3 akn:art_f__para_16-4 akn:art_f__para_16-5
GIVEN `grade set` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grade the conversion may set` `grade set` IF
    TRUNC (`grade set` TIMES 2) 0 EQUALS `grade set` TIMES 2

-- 16.3–16.4: an existing teacher's conversion uses March's salary of the
-- year before she joins, for a 100% position by her roles. Years by the
-- calendar year.
GIVEN `calendar year of joining` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the calendar year of the March salary converted` `calendar year of joining` IS
    `calendar year of joining` MINUS 1

-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p2 Points to the salary tables; not in the corpus.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p3 The address; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p4 Points to the 2016 shekel-supplement circular; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p5 The address; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p6 Points to the Ofek 2022 supplement circular; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_16-5/p7 The address; no rule.

§§ `17 מקדמות שכר עד לקביעת הדרגה`

-- akn:art_f__para_16-5__subpara_17 The heading of section 17, which the corpus nests under 16.5; its items follow.

-- 17.1–17.2: until the grade is set, an advance on top of the current pay,
-- on the listed components, for the part in a joined kindergarten, from
-- joining; then the salary is recomputed back, and what was paid, the
-- advance included, is set off. 17.3: academics — a kindergarten teacher
-- 16%, a health-profession teacher 14%, an intern 14%; non-academics (28
-- years and up) 10%.
DECLARE `advance group` IS ONE OF
    `academic kindergarten teacher`
    `academic health-profession teacher`
    `intern`
    `non-academic of 28 years or more`

@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p2 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p3 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p4 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p5 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p6
GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the advance rate` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `academic kindergarten teacher` THEN 0.16
    WHEN `academic health-profession teacher` THEN 0.14
    WHEN `intern` THEN 0.14
    WHEN `non-academic of 28 years or more` THEN 0.1

@ref akn:art_f__para_17-1 akn:art_f__para_17-2
GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`, `current components` IS A NUMBER, `share in joined kindergartens` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash advance` g `current components` `share in joined kindergartens` IS
    `the advance rate` g TIMES `current components` TIMES `share in joined kindergartens`

-- The owner pays the advance until the grade is set; the text sets no
-- month for it.
GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`, `current components` IS A NUMBER, `share in joined kindergartens` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the advance paid until the grade is set` g `current components` `share in joined kindergartens` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `the Ofek Hadash advance` g `current components` `share in joined kindergartens`

@ref akn:art_f__para_17-2/p2
GIVEN `salary by Ofek Hadash from joining` IS A NUMBER, `paid from joining, advance included` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the retroactive difference` `salary by Ofek Hadash from joining` `paid from joining, advance included` IS
    `salary by Ofek Hadash from joining` MINUS `paid from joining, advance included`

-- Where the circular and the collective agreements conflict, the
-- agreements prevail.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3/p7
GIVEN `the circular's answer` IS A NUMBER, `the agreements' answer` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the governing answer` `the circular's answer` `the agreements' answer` IS
    `the agreements' answer`

-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p8 Information at the addresses of annex F; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p9 The sign-off (¶9-¶30), which the corpus places inside 17.3; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p10 The signatories; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p11 Their posts; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p12 Their divisions; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p13 The heading of the copies list; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p14 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p15 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p16 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p17 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p18 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p19 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p20 Copy recipients; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p21 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p22 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p23 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p24 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p25 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p26 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p27 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p28 A copy recipient; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_17-3/p29 A copy recipient; no rule.
