§§ `כתב ההתחייבות`

-- The owner's undertaking (¶31-¶38 and items 1-7, which the corpus places
-- inside 17.3): to apply every Ofek Hadash provision to the teachers in its
-- special-education kindergartens — the week, the length of the day, the
-- pay and the pedagogical rules (1); to pass the Ministry the teachers'
-- data as it requires (2); to pay the advance and mark it on the payslip,
-- send each teacher annex A's letter and have each sign annex B (3); to
-- keep those undertakings and pass them on demand (4); to have an
-- under-qualified teacher who asks to join sign to complete the education
-- and send annex C (5); to pass the payslips on demand (6); a teacher may
-- ask not to join through the owner on annex D (7). Failure may bring
-- sanctions, including setting off the funding and up to revoking the
-- licence.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3/p31 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p34 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p35 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p36 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p37 akn:art_f__para_17-3/p38 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_1 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_2 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3__cls_a akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3__cls_b akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_3__cls_c akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_4 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_5 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_6 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p2 akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_7/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the undertaking` IS
    ((PARTY `the owning body`
      MUST  `apply all the Ofek Hadash provisions`)
     RAND
     (PARTY `the owning body`
      MUST  `send the teachers' data as the Ministry requires`)
     RAND
     (PARTY `the owning body`
      MUST  `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` a
            PROVIDED a GREATER THAN 0)
     RAND
     (PARTY `the owning body`
      MUST  `mark the advance on the payslip`)
     RAND
     (PARTY `the owning body`
      MUST  `send each teacher the advance letter`)
     RAND
     (PARTY `the owning body`
      MUST  `have each teacher sign the advance undertaking`)
     RAND
     (PARTY `the owning body`
      MUST  `keep the teachers' undertakings and pass them on demand`)
     RAND
     (PARTY `the owning body`
      MUST  `have an under-qualified joiner sign to complete the education and send annex C`)
     RAND
     (PARTY `the owning body`
      MUST  `pass the payslips on demand`)
     RAND
     (PARTY `the teaching employee`
      MAY   `submit a request not to join` d))

GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten party` `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `sanctions on failure` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry`
    MAY   `impose sanctions up to revoking the licence`

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_02-a: the undertaking's heading starts it in תשפ"ו,
-- its item 1 "משנת הלימודים תשפ"ה ואילך". School years by the calendar
-- year they open in.
@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3/p31
`the undertaking's start by its heading` MEANS 2025

@ref akn:art_f__para_17-3__subpara_1
`the undertaking's start by item 1` MEANS 2024

`the undertaking's heading and item 1 name different first years` MEANS
    NOT (`the undertaking's start by its heading` EQUALS `the undertaking's start by item 1`)
#ASSERT `the undertaking's heading and item 1 name different first years`

