§§ `נספחים א'-ב' המקדמה`

-- Annex A, the owner's letter (kept by the owner): the kindergarten joined
-- Ofek Hadash in תשפ"ו; the grade, and so the pay, will be set by the
-- Ministry; until then an advance is paid, shown as "מקדמת אופק חדש", and
-- deducted in full, with the pre-reform pay, once the salary by the grade
-- is paid, subject to the Wage Protection Law. Annex B: the teacher signs
-- that the advance is on account and will be deducted in full, waiving
-- claims.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p11 akn:att_1__hc_1/p13 akn:att_1__hc_1/p14 akn:att_1__hc_1/p15 akn:att_1__hc_1/p16 akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1/p4 akn:att_2__hc_1/p5 akn:att_2__hc_1/p6 akn:att_2__hc_1/p7
GIVEN `salary by the grade` IS A NUMBER, `pre-reform pay` IS A NUMBER, advance IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `paid once the grade is set` `salary by the grade` `pre-reform pay` advance IS
    `salary by the grade` MINUS `pre-reform pay` MINUS advance

