-- Annex C (exceptional joining, for an academic without a certificate): an
-- academic degree means one from a recognised Israeli institution, a
-- foreign degree approved as equivalent, or studies giving an equivalent
-- salary grade approved by the division or its districts; the teacher
-- acknowledges no promotion until certified and that the reform's terms
