§§ `נספח ה' מבנה שבוע העבודה של גננות`

-- Annex E's worked rows: role, base, position and actual weekly hours,
-- for a teacher working Sunday-Thursday 7:55-14:00 and Friday
-- 7:55-12:45 (a different day changes the position).
@desc A row of annex E as printed.
DECLARE `annex E row` HAS
    `row role`           IS A `kindergarten role`
    `row base`           IS A NUMBER
    `row position`       IS A NUMBER
    `row actual hours`   IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/p1 akn:att_5__hc_1/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1/p3 akn:att_5__hc_1/p4 akn:att_5__hc_1/p5 akn:att_5__hc_1/p6 akn:att_5__hc_1/p7 akn:att_5__hc_1/p8 akn:att_5__hc_1/p9 akn:att_5__hc_1/p10 akn:att_5__hc_1/p11 akn:att_5__hc_1/p12 akn:att_5__hc_1/p13 akn:att_5__hc_1/p14 akn:att_5__hc_1/p15 akn:att_5__hc_1/p16 akn:att_5__hc_1/p17 akn:att_5__hc_1/p18 akn:att_5__hc_1/p19 akn:att_5__hc_1/p20 akn:att_5__hc_1/p21 akn:att_5__hc_1/p22
`annex E rows 1-5` MEANS
    LIST `annex E row` `kindergarten manager` 30.4 1 30.4,
         `annex E row` `kindergarten manager` 30.4 1 27.4,
         `annex E row` `kindergarten manager` 30.4 1.1 30.4,
         `annex E row` `associate kindergarten teacher` 33.8 0.9 30.8,
         `annex E row` `associate kindergarten teacher` 33.8 0.9 27.8

-- Row 1: a manager working five days of 6.08 hours: 30.4 hours, 100%.
#ASSERT 5 TIMES 6.08 EQUALS 30.4

-- F-2025-26_tashpo_02-j: row 4 is an associate working "5 days a week,
-- 6.08 each day", whose position is "up to 90% only because she actually
-- works 30.8 weekly hours". Five days of 6.08 are 30.4 hours, not 30.8;
-- and 30.8 over her base of 33.8 is 91.1%, not 90%. Rows 10 and 12 (95.5%
-- on a base of 31.8) count 30.4.
`row 4's hours are not five days of 6.08` MEANS
        (NOT ((at `annex E rows 1-5` 3)'s `row actual hours` EQUALS 5 TIMES 6.08))
    AND TRUNC (`the position` (5 TIMES 6.08) 33.8 TIMES 100) 0 EQUALS 89
    AND TRUNC (`the position` 30.8 33.8 TIMES 1000) 0 EQUALS 911
#ASSERT `row 4's hours are not five days of 6.08`

-- Rows 7-12: a teacher with age hours who still works five days has a
-- position above 100% on her reduced base.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/p32 akn:att_5__hc_1/p33 akn:att_5__hc_1/p34 akn:att_5__hc_1/p35 akn:att_5__hc_1/p36 akn:att_5__hc_1/p37 akn:att_5__hc_1/p38 akn:att_5__hc_1/p39 akn:att_5__hc_1/p40 akn:att_5__hc_1/p41 akn:att_5__hc_1/p42 akn:att_5__hc_1/p43 akn:att_5__hc_1/p44 akn:att_5__hc_1/p45 akn:att_5__hc_1/p46 akn:att_5__hc_1/p47 akn:att_5__hc_1/p48 akn:att_5__hc_1/p49 akn:att_5__hc_1/p50 akn:att_5__hc_1/p51 akn:att_5__hc_1/p52 akn:att_5__hc_1/p53 akn:att_5__hc_1/p54 akn:att_5__hc_1/p55 akn:att_5__hc_1/p61 akn:att_5__hc_1/p62 akn:att_5__hc_1/p63
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, base IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position in tenths of a percent` `weekly hours` base IS
    TRUNC (`the position` `weekly hours` base TIMES 1000 PLUS 0.5) 0

-- Row 7: 30.4 on 28.4 is 107%; less a day every two weeks (3.04 hours),
-- 96.3%. Row 8: on 26.4, 115.15%; less a day every two weeks, 103.6%;
-- less a day a week, 92.1%. Row 10: on 31.8, 95.6% (printed 95.5).
#ASSERT `the position in tenths of a percent` 30.4 28.4 EQUALS 1070
#ASSERT `the position in tenths of a percent` (30.4 MINUS 3.04) 28.4 EQUALS 963
#ASSERT `the position in tenths of a percent` 30.4 26.4 EQUALS 1152
#ASSERT `the position in tenths of a percent` (30.4 MINUS 6.08) 26.4 EQUALS 921

-- Rows 13-17: the cluster's coordinator 30.4 at 100%; a cluster manager 34
-- at 100% (110% as a mother never absent), 32 at 50-55 or new from 50, 30
-- existing from 55 — the bases of 4.1.1.
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/p64 akn:att_5__hc_1/p65 akn:att_5__hc_1/p66 akn:att_5__hc_1/p67 akn:att_5__hc_1/p68 akn:att_5__hc_1/p69 akn:att_5__hc_1/p70 akn:att_5__hc_1/p71 akn:att_5__hc_1/p72 akn:att_5__hc_1/p73 akn:att_5__hc_1/p74 akn:att_5__hc_1/p75 akn:att_5__hc_1/p76 akn:att_5__hc_1/p77 akn:att_5__hc_1/p78 akn:att_5__hc_1/p79 akn:att_5__hc_1/p80 akn:att_5__hc_1/p81 akn:att_5__hc_1/p82 akn:att_5__hc_1/p83 akn:att_5__hc_1/p84
`annex E's cluster bases agree with 4.1.1` MEANS
        `the position base` `cluster manager` `under 50` EQUALS 34
    AND `the position base` `cluster manager` `50 to 55` EQUALS 32
    AND `the position base` `cluster manager` `55 and over, existing` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `annex E's cluster bases agree with 4.1.1`

